" x=\"62.08272\" xlink:href=\"#m9d3abcc3fc\" y=\"160.613121\"></use>\n     <use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"102.527768\" xlink:href=\"#m9d3abcc3fc\" y=\"160.613121\"></use>\n     <use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"142.972815\" xlink:href=\"#m9d3abcc3fc\" y=\"99.94555\"></use>\n     <use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"183.417863\" xlink:href=\"#m9d3abcc3fc\" y=\"79.723026\"></use>\n     <use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"223.86291\" xlink:href=\"#m9d3abcc3fc\" y=\"79.723026\"></use>\n    </g>\n   </g>\n  </g>\n </g>\n <defs>\n  <clipPath id=\"p240ac9b5ce\">\n   <rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"262.488358\" x=\"9.200821\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n  </clipPath>\n </defs>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for scatterplot\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>The scatterplot has 5 data points.</li><li>The data points are in a linear pattern trending up from left to right.</li><li>A line of best fit is shown:<br><ul><li>The line of best fit slants up from left to right.</li><li>The line of best fit passes through the following approximate coordinates:<br><ul><li>(0 comma 3.20)</li><li>(1 comma 3.80)</li><li>(2 comma 4.40)</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which of the following is closest to the slope of this line of best fit?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"b4801386-032a-4d6f-a845-d2ddfe34b0a3","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0.60\"><mn>0.60</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"400911a9-97b3-4ecc-ab4e-a73170b10cd8","content":"<p><math alttext=\"2.50\"><mn>2.50</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"f59adaff-495b-4856-af7c-63f46787d7dd","content":"<p><math alttext=\"7.80\"><mn>7.80</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"2bb4d8e9-c125-4b1b-b1bb-536160cea001","content":"<p><math alttext=\"8.00\"><mn>8.00</mn>\n</math></p>"}],"keys":["b4801386-032a-4d6f-a845-d2ddfe34b0a3"],"correct_answer":["A"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. A line in the <em>xy</em>-plane that passes through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis x 1 comma y 1 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis x 2 comma y 2 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math> has a slope of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction y 2 minus y 1 Over x 2 minus x 1 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>. The line of best fit shown passes through the points with approximate coordinates <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 3.2 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3.2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 2 comma 4.4 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4.4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. It follows that the slope of the line of best fit is approximately <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 4.4 minus 3.2 Over 2 minus 0 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4.4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3.2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, which is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 1.2 Over 2 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>1.2</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"0.6\"><mn>0.6</mn></math>. Therefore, of the given choices, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"0.6\"><mn>0.6</mn></math> is closest to the slope of the line of best fit shown.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1776362727993,"pPcc":"SAT#Q","questionId":"38525983","skill_cd":"Q.D.","score_band_range_cd":4,"skill_desc":"Two-variable data: Models and scatterplots","createDate":1776362727993,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","ibn":"","external_id":"76b9ab2a-a161-4577-8b1b-7e587c2a4543","primary_class_cd":"Q","uId":"ab016d83-0bc3-4609-a5c3-3d566ecf3ba1","difficulty":"M"},"raw_detail":{"type":"mcq","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The scatterplot shows the relationship between <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>. A line of best fit is also shown.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg height=\"275.22pt\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 286.56 275.22\" width=\"286.56pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A scatterplot in the x y plane with the origin labeled O. The x axis ranges from 0 to 10. The y axis ranges from 0 to 10. Refer to long description.\">\n <defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 275.22 \nL 286.56 275.22 \nL 286.56 0 \nL 0 0 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 260.46 \nL 279.36 260.46 \nL 279.36 10.98 \nL 7.2 10.98 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_2\">\n   